window.products.push({"id":986113,"name":"Trunki Kid’s Travel Neck Pillow with Magnetic Child’s Chin Support - Yondi Small Felix Fox (Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811nK7vb5BL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Felix the Red Fox Yondi is a specially designed travel pillow that connects under the chin with hidden magnets to form a soft and supportive cushion. This stops your child's head rolling forward so they can snooze in comfort. Ergonomically designed with a narrow profile to provide extra support when using child seats with existing headrests; perfect for car seats, plane seats, bike seats and also for buggies and strollers. It also comes with the unique Trunki Grip (TM) so your little one can attach their favourite comforter or blanket. Ideal for travelling by car, plane, pushchair or bike. Kids can now wake up fully rested after their journey with the Trunki Yondi neck pillow. NOTE: This product is small sized and designed for approx. 18 mnts -3 years with neck circumference less than 30cm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811nK7vb5BL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trunki","source_asin":"B00RXTQOTM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986113","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RXTQOTM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RXTQOTM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":986114,"name":"Baking mats with macaron pattern (2-pack, half-sheet, mini baby pink border)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1+qnaTYnXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"After looking for silicone baking mats in the market to make macarons, we could not find anything that would meet what we would like to have on a baking mat. We came up with the mat with perfect thickness and pattern. The spaces between the big circles are just perfect. Not too close so that the macaron shells ended up sticking together when baked. Not too far that yields only a few shells per sheet. Perfect use of space on a sheet. That is why we make 2 different patterns. One for mini-sized macarons that yields 53 shells per sheet. One for regular-sized that yields 28 shells per sheet. Used in place of parchment to help prevent sticking or burning. This flexible modern baking mat of silicone-coated fiberglass cloth turns any surface or pan into an easy-release, non-stick surface for dough prep and baking. Mat may be placed directly on the oven rack, cleans up in the dishwasher, and rolls up for compact storage. These mats are made by bakers for bakers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1+qnaTYnXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mittelain","source_asin":"B07PHH44M1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986114","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PHH44M1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PHH44M1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":986115,"name":"Existence is Pain Decal, Funny Car Windshield Decal, H 6.5 by L 8.5 Inches (H 6.5 by L 8.5 Inches, Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41eWlFLwDzL._AC_.jpg","description":"These Materials are needed to install your decal on almost any clean and flat surface, such as a windshield, laptop, wall, or other smooth surface with simple curves : Water, Paper Towel/Rag, Credit Card/Drivers License, and Scotch tape. Before installing your decal, remove any air bubbles that may have formed from temperature changes during shipping by taking your decal into a cooled environment, then use a credit/debit card to smooth out your decal until most, or all of the air bubbles disappear. Then, clean your desired surface with WATER ONLY. (Do Not Use soap or other cleaners. The adhesive from your decal may have a hard time sticking to them.) After cleaning your surface, tape a piece of scotch tape horizontally to the top of your decal. Then, stick your decal to your clean surface. Now that your decal sticks to your surface, flip it up so that you see the back of your decal. Then, peel your clear transfer tape away from the backing until you can pull the backing away from the scotch tape. Then, with a credit card, start from the top of your decal image and apply it to your clean surface. Please wait 3 to 5 minutes for your decal to adhere. Then, slowly peel off the clear transfer tape until the only thing sticking to your surface is your decal image. (If your decal image starts coming off as you peel away your clear transfer tape, stop peeling and squeegee your decal with a credit card. Repeat this process until your decal sticks.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41eWlFLwDzL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dan's Decals","source_asin":"B071HPTDYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986115","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071HPTDYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071HPTDYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
