window.products.push({"id":986162,"name":"Tropical Hawaiian Toddler Bedding 5 pc Boys Surf Bedding Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61evy8QBiAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 5pc Blue and Brown Surf toddler bedding collection by Sweet Jojo Designs will transform your room into a tropical Hawaiian paradise. This totally awesome boy bedding set features detailed beach and surf themed appliques and embroidery works including surfboards, tropical leaves, and palm trees. This set uses a color palette of ocean blues, chocolate brown, orange, green, and ivory. It uses all 100% cotton, exclusive Sweet Jojo Designs fabrics including a brown and ivory Hawaiian leaf print, a multi colored designer stripe, and a true surfer plaid. It also boasts coordinating ocean blue solid cottons to bring out the cool surfer theme for your child's bedroom. All pieces are non allergenic and machine washable for ease and repeated use. This bedding set fits all standard crib and toddler beds and is fully inspected for the highest quality. Your set includes these 5 pieces: LightweightToddler Comforter (48\" x 60\") Standard Sham (20\" x 26\") Standard Pillowcase (20\" x 30\") Fitted Sheet (28\" x 52\") Flat Sheet (42\" x 70\") Toddler Comforter The comforter is designed using all 100% cotton fabrics in a patchwork style featuring appliques including surfboards and tropical leaves with a Hawaiian leaf print border.  It reverses to the multi stripe designer print on the back. Standard Sham The matching sham is designed using a large surfboard applique in the center with the multi colored designer stripe border. 3 pc Toddler Bedding Sheet Set Also included is a 100% cotton, coordinating sheet set using solid blue fabric with the Hawaiian leaf print trim and dark blue piping. Your 3 pc includes: 1 Pillowcase, 1 Fitted Sheet and 1 Flat Sheet. This Set does not come with the bed skirt, but the bed skirt may be added. Please see related items. Other Colors Available (Click Picture to View):","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61evy8QBiAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweet Jojo Designs","source_asin":"B003NY2GT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986162","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003NY2GT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003NY2GT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
