window.products.push({"id":986171,"name":"Wearable Blanket Kids 3-10yr, Fun Animal Kids Blanket Hoodie, Kids Comfy Hoodie Blanket, Kids Hooded Blanket Girl Boy Toddler (Pink Bunny Hoodie)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614UhpWndLL._AC_SL1068_.jpg","description":"Fleece Imported FUN & SNUGGLY – The Big Softy Animal Blanket Hoodie for Kids has layers of cuddly fleece on the outside and soft fuzzy sherpa on the inside. With 3 cute animal favorites to choose from, this is a wearable blanket kids love. THICKER & WARMER – Unlike cheaper alternatives, our kids blanket hoodie is made from significantly thicker (high gsm) material, and is reversible with no visible stitching on the inside. It’s designed to instantly leave your kids comfy, warm & fuzzy. TAKES THE CHILL OUT OF COLD MORNINGS – Warm kids are happy kids, and wearing a comfy snuggle blanket is like starting every morning with a warm hug! Use it at home while watching TV, studying, or playing video games… or take it with you for camping, beach days & more. EASY TO SLIP ON & CARE FOR – Why struggle with pajamas or onesies when your little ones are damp? This kids wearable blanket hoodie slips on easily and takes the fuss out of bath time. Plus, they’re easy to care for – Just machine wash cold & tumble dry on low. GREAT GIFT FOR 3-10 YRS – GUARENTEED – Our kids oversized blanket hoodie makes an excellent gift for girls or boys aged 3-10. It makes a great kids or toddler wearable blanket. We’re confident you’ll love it, but if you change your mind for any reason, we offer a full 30 day manufacturer’s money back guarantee or lifetime replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614UhpWndLL._AC_SL1068_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Big Softy","source_asin":"B0BN3SSJ5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN3SSJ5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN3SSJ5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
