window.products.push({"id":986253,"name":"Premium Arrowhead Lot, 110 pcs Indian Agate Stone Arrowhead Set by Ashkii","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yfjbR2PmL._AC_.jpg","description":"Arrowheads are Hand crafted using primitive percussion and pressure flint knapping art techniques! (The Agate Stone used in the production of Ashkii Arrowheads is natural and not color enhanced in any way) This Lot Includes: ► 110 bird points – Measures Approx. 1”-1.5” ► 1 Ashkii carry sack Ashkii Arrowhead reproductions make a great addition to any arrowhead collection and are wonderful for just about any age group. It is important to preserve the knowledge about this art for all future generations. Ashkii arrowheads strive to make each modern point and artifact a well worked lasting treasure at a great overall value. Your Ashkii Arrowhead Purchase is backed by our 100% Guarantee. If for any reason you are not completely happy with your purchase please contact us, and we promise to make things right. Note: Since each point is struck from a different stone expect some slight color variations between each piece, and lot purchased. ( Arrowheads can be sharp, please handle carefully) There so many things to do with arrowheads; here is a short list! Making Primitive Bow & Arrows, Jewelry Making, Dream Catchers, Framed Arrowhead Picture Displays, Archaeology Sandbox Dig Parties, Classroom Geology Lessons, Cub Scout Arrow of Light awards, Craft Projects, Flower Pot Bedding, Fish tanks, Stocking Stuffers, Party Favors, Gifts, Home Décor, and a variety of other things! A portion of the proceeds of each sale will be donated to a non-profit organization impacting lives every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yfjbR2PmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Allaser","source_asin":"B01HBXXRU8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HBXXRU8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HBXXRU8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
