window.products.push({"id":986260,"name":"HLC.ME Carol Floral Embroidered Thermal Room Darkening Blackout Window Curtain Grommet Panels for Sliding Glass Patio Doors - Energy Efficient & Extra","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ui4MjFtZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Looking to add a dash of elegance to your living spaces while improving comfort? With these curtains from HLC.ME, the beauty is much more than skin deep. Beyond the stunning design and array of fashionable colors, insulated curtain panels block out disruptive light and help maintain a comfortable temperature in your home. ' Light blocking ' Thermal insulated for heat / cool air retention ' Premium blackout fabric ' Beautiful, no-fade design ' Sturdy metal grommets (not plastic) ' Wide array of colors and sizes available ' For indoor use only Studies show that light from outside can be detrimental to our sleep ' and the thin, sheer curtains that are so popular today aren't much help. These Carol Blackout Curtains from HLC.ME allow you to infuse your home with supreme style while creating a sleep sanctuary in your master bedroom , child's bedroom , or nursery by blocking 85% of all light entering the room from the outside. The secret of our curtain panels is our innovative triple-weave material, which effectively blocks light from shining through (85% of light). Our blackout curtains are sturdy without being too heavy and bulky and provide a high-end decorative touch. Feel like warm or cool air just goes right out the window (along with your hard-earned money)? HLC.ME Blackout Curtains are the ideal complement to your efforts to conserve energy at home. Each panel features a thin thermal lining to prevent heat and cold air from entering your home, keeping your living spaces at a comfortable temperature all year long. Machine washable: Dust build-up or stains on your curtains? No need to fret; Machine Washable!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ui4MjFtZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HLC.ME","source_asin":"B07WJSCQBB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WJSCQBB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WJSCQBB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":986261,"name":"Tabic Prestige Brass Moon Phase Clock on a Solid English Oak Mantel/Display Mount","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":269.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ykAUjTnYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Prestige Moon Phase Clock With a Jet Black Dial Mounted on a Solid English Oak Mantel/Display Mount. Dark Stain Varnish Finish (beautifully made by local wood turner) Case Dimensions - 155mm Diameter. 45mm Depth. 1.5mm thick brass case. Mount dimensions - approx - 210mm x 55mm x 55mm and are designed to fit to any of our clocks, including pre fitted foam protection pad and Baize/felt base THE QUALITY OF THESE CLOCKS ARE REFLECTED BY THEIR WEIGHT. (beware of light weight imitations) New Moon Phase clock set in a heavy six inch brass case with a flat glass (not plastic) front and rubber seal, Then Mounted on a 1st quality Clear Lacquered English Oak Mount. These are not a mass production product; each one is individually hand made using the thickest brass possible that can be turned by hand. You will not be disappointed with this quality item. Operated by a Lunar quartz movement which requires 1 AA battery (not supplied). The clock is suitable for any area and comes complete with instructions plus interesting information on the different Moon Phases. This is a 'must have' for anyone, would make an ideal gift for any occasion or superb corporate gift. We are a small family run business and pride ourselves on quality products. Please Note. There are a lot of variables to take into account when tracking the moons orbit of approx. (never exactly) 29.53 days, so the clock may need adjustment. Northern hemisphere ( rotates clockwise) clocks will be sent to the northern hemisphere and southern hemisphere ( rotates anti-clockwise ) clocks will be sent to the southern hemisphere unless you state otherwise, and all dials are set to the correct rotation Thank you for looking Please see our other items for interesting matching clocks. Handmade in England.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ykAUjTnYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tabic","source_asin":"B08862G5ZH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08862G5ZH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08862G5ZH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
