window.products.push({"id":986375,"name":"Twin 6 Piece White Bed Sheets Set- 6 Flat Sheets (66x108)- 6 Fitted Sheets (39x80+10) and 12 Standard Pillowcases T-200 Economy Grade Bedding Sheets &","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":110.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516OJlQ0zgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Imported - 6 Pack Twin White Bed Sheets Set T200 - Available in all sizes & qualities. Set includes 6 Flat Sheets (66x108)- 6 Fitted Sheets (39x80+10) and 12 Standard Pillowcases pack. Material - Classic 60% Cotton / 40% Polyester - Percale Weave. These Cotton-rich white sheet set bulk are ideal to cover your bed. Each sheet is expertly woven together to ensure No pilling, No fade, and long-lasting strength. Quality - Economy Twin sheet set deep pocket are made from a cotton rich and designed for durability. These are multi-purpose sheets set super soft, cozy and it is very comfortable to sleep in.as well as for Hotel, Hospitality & Home Bedding, massage, spa, baby use, and pets. Easy Care - These Cotton-rich flat sheets, fitted sheet and pillowcases offer a softer feel and the cotton & polyester mix produces an easy care finish resulting in less ironing. Machine washable and long lasting. Our Polycotton flat sheet set dry fast and are completely machine washable especially designed to make the dryer take less time, thus saving time and energy costs. Tumble try on low heat or hang to air dry. Value for Money - We value our customers and strive to build long-term relationships through excellent customer care. Please Note this is a economy Sheet set even If you are unsatisfied with your purchase at any point and for any reason, you can contact us. Our customer service team will work with you to make it right!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516OJlQ0zgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOLD TEXTILES","source_asin":"B07D2CKDSP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D2CKDSP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D2CKDSP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":986376,"name":"Quadro Frames 10x28 inch Picture Frame Black, Style P375-3/8 inch Wide Molding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512hmFo31ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All our picture frames are produced on demand at our facility in Spencer MA using our exclusive Quadro Frames molding system. Moldings are custom extruded to our specifications and consist of ABS plastic with a metallized mylar finish, they are virtually indistinguishable from a metal frame at a fraction of the cost. Backing panels are 0.10 inch thick MDF (Medium Density Fiberboard) - NOT cheap corrugated cardboard. Front panels are 0.040\" thick optically clear PET plastic with an opaque and/or blue protective peel away film applied to both sides. While assembling your frames make sure to peel off the protective film from BOTH sides of the plastic panel. The frames dimensions refer to the PANELS so that media of the specified size will fit in the frame. The external dimensions of the frame are 3/8 inch larger than nominal size. The visible image size (accounting for the overlap of the moldings over the panels) is 3/4 inch less than the nominal size. The moldings are side loading and in additional to the panels provided will accomodate 3/16 inches of media thickness. This is sufficient space for an image as well as a double standard thickness matteboard. All components are manufactured to the highest tolerances for a picture frame of seamless fit and finish. Assembly is required but consists simply of snapping four (4) corner connectors onto the moldings, no tools are required the frames literally snap together in seconds. The corner connectors fit onto the back side of the moldings and are not visible from the front or sides. The frames are designed to hang from the corner connectors, which include an arc shaped sawtooth pattern for fine levelling adjustment on the spot! These classic contemporary style picture frames are an excellent choice for framing virtually any image with a professional gallery look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512hmFo31ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quadro Frames","source_asin":"B00XIMCYGU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XIMCYGU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XIMCYGU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
