window.products.push({"id":986415,"name":"Hamilton Hills 24\" x 36\" Contemporary Home Accented Black Framed Polished Stainless Steel Rectangular Mirror| Designer Vanity Hanging Mirror for Bathr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ymSjVPBkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BOLD DESIGN: Our contemporary accented mirror with contrasting black and chrome corners is the perfect addition to an entry way or vanity mirror or bathroom mirror. A polished chrome metal corner with chrom rivest surround 1 1/4\" wide and 1 3/4\" deep black frame. The mirrored plate glass is back set 1\" giving the mirror a substantial look and high end finish. Overall rectangular dimensions of 24\" x 36\". SAFE AND EASY TO INSTALL: Our glass is safely custom mounted and protected by the surrounding frame construction. The mirror is recessed into the deep frame. The bathroom vanity mirror comes with reinforced D-ring hanging clips as well as the wall hardware and screws to easily hang the mirror on walls in a bathroom, entry way or over a table. The vanity mirror hangs both horizontally or vertically (landscape or portrait). 3 GENERATIONS OF EXCELLENCE: Our family has been manufacturing and producing mirrors for over 3 generations. We stand by the quality of our product and your experience. A family owned business with simple principles. Affordable quality from an American company. EXCEPTIONAL QUALITY: We use premium materials not found in other lesser quality imitation mirrors you will see. Our mirrors are made to strict trade-secret standards and pass a rigorous 8 point inspection. Every mirror comes with our certification of authenticity. There is a reason others copy Hamilton Hills. We set the standards and others try and emulate. This mirror is a great accent piece for any room in the home. It comes with a stand and hooks to hang the mirror on your wall. The frame has an antique black finish with chrome accents around the edge of the mirror. This would be perfect over your dresser or on your bathroom wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ymSjVPBkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Hills","source_asin":"B081S9HBN4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081S9HBN4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081S9HBN4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
