window.products.push({"id":986439,"name":"2 PACK 20-inch Pop-Up Foldable Collapsible Mesh Laundry Hamper With Side Pocket, Sturdy Durable Storage Basket Foldable Storage Containers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61juHf92SuL._AC_.jpg","description":"Xelue FF is the \"exclusive\" brand for Cynthia International（Unbelievable! More surprise here!） . No other sellers are authorized to sell Xelue FF products. Make sure you buy from Cynthia International（Unbelievable! More surprise here!）.WATCH OUT FOR FAKE and POOR IMITATIONS.The mesh pop-up laundry hamper has become a popular staple for college students who live in dorm rooms and for apartment dwellers, both of whom have to carry their dirty clothes and linens to the laundry room—which may not necessarily be in their building.  But they’re also handy to have in homes and on camping trips. That’s because the pop-up laundry hampers are convenient, roomy—and a smart idea. It’s made of sturdy construction, yet it’s easy to twist it open and fold it flat again for storage when it’s not in use. Simply twist both short ends in the opposite direction and it folds. Because it folds flat, you can even stick it in your suitcase if you want to take it on a trip. The flexible, lightweight frame is able to hold a full load of laundry. Its mesh construction makes it breathable to eliminate dirty laundry odors and moisture. A convenient side pocket is roomy enough to store laundry detergent and fabric softener. Two sturdy handles make it easy to carry with one hand.  Include:1 pcs.Size:folding size,16cm*16cm.fully unfolding size,32cm*32cm*52cm.Weight:90g.Nylon polyester mesh. Lightweight, Easy to Carry & Store. When not in use, simply folded up to save space.Use for laundry, toy storage, or store things you want to for a beach outing. Its mesh constructions make the laundry hamper breathable to eliminate laundry odors and moisture. Made of 100% polyester mesh with sturdy steel frame, solid polyester bottom makes this washing bag extremely stable and durable, can be used in apartments, college dorms, homes and camping. A convenient side pocket is roomy enough to store detergents and two handles make carrying easy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61juHf92SuL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xelue FF","source_asin":"B06XZTCSY8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XZTCSY8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XZTCSY8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":986440,"name":"Swivel Wonder Hanger, Space-Saving Closet Organizers, 4 Pack, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DsQmOK44L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When your space is organized, you can achieve greater peace of mind. You don’t need to worry about a cluttered home anymore, thanks to Swivel Wonder Hanger. This organizing system maximizes your closet, giving you more room to hang all of your clothes and garments. Plus, it makes your closet look neat, clean, and tidy. The Swivel Wonder Hanger features 6 evenly-spaced notches that are designed to hold your hangers either horizontally or vertically. To hang your garments vertically, simply detach one of the hooks from the closet rod. The Swivel Wonder Hanger will cascade down while still holding your clothes! This design allows you to triple your closet space! It also helps prevent wrinkles. The Swivel Wonder Hanger is built to be heavy-duty. You can hang up even the bulkiest of garments with ease, including heavy winter jackets, formal gowns and dresses, suits, and more. With your order, you’ll receive 4 Swivel Wonder Hangers l. Each Swivel Wonder Hanger has 6 slots to store your hangers. You can double up the hangers on each notch, making it so that a single Swivel Wonder Hanger holds 12 garments. In total, you’ll be able to hang 48 garments, thanks to your 5-pack set. These hangers are made from metal chrome, making them durable and long-lasting. They won’t warp, bend, or lose their shape over time, so you’ll be able to enjoy them for years to come. This system is ideal for apartments, college dorm rooms, seasonal closets, offices, and other small spaces. They’re also great for travel and transportation because you can tuck them into a garment bag or RV closet. It’s time to tidy up your closet by purchasing the Swivel Wonder Hanger! Add these hangers to your home essentials today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DsQmOK44L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wonder Hanger","source_asin":"B07QHKXQLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986440","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QHKXQLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QHKXQLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
