window.products.push({"id":986453,"name":"2 Cloud9 Classic Comfort Shredded Visco Elastic Memory Foam Pillows - King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21RAF-9gHpL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Cloud9 Classic Comfort Pillow will kindle a sincere delight when it's time to retire for the night. Our exclusive, Cloud9 Shredded Memory Foam formula makes you feel like you are floating on CLOUD 9, sailing forth into a sea of enchanted dreams. This supple visco-elastic material allows for freedom and ease of bodily movement, so you can snuggle into a comfortable position and sleep like a baby from the time you go to bed until you awaken refreshed and renewed, prepared to take on the day. Our proprietary formula establishes our luxuriant, Cloud9 Classic Comfort Pillow shredded visco-elastic material light years beyond the competition. Which explains why our reputation is renowned throughout the bedding industry. Your pillow should conform at your neck (between your head and shoulders) to help relieve pressure and prevent pain. Cloud9 Classic Comfort Pillows are made of the same Shredded Originally developed for NASA material as the memory foam mattress. These heat-sensitive pillows are filled with thousands of tiny peices of shredded visco elastic memory foam and has the classic style in design. The Cloud9 Classic Comfort pillow provides therapeutic head and neck support; properly aligning your head and neck with your spine. A pillow that forces your head too high or allows it to fall too far back not only places stress on your neck, but also inhibits air flow through your breathing channels. This painful combination is uncomfortable and can lead to back and neck pain, snoring and other sinus related problems - and at the very least...a poor night's sleep. That's where this amazing classic comfort pillow separates itself from any other pillow you have ever had.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21RAF-9gHpL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cloud9 Bedding Memory Foam","source_asin":"B06W59W1C3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06W59W1C3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06W59W1C3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
