window.products.push({"id":986482,"name":"Jupiter Amber Stone Crystal Aura Cube, 1.2\" Sides (0.15lbs), Carved from Real North American Onyx Aragonite - The Artisan Mined Series by hBAR","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jMrjXOm-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This cube was mined, carved, and finished by hand to ensure the highest level of quality. Made from amber onyx aragonite, each cube has its own unique coat of bands, eyes, voids, and veins, but all look stunning. The amber color, with shocks of rust, cream, and grey, while being almost a perfect cube, gives you a feeling of calmness and serenity. The smooth stone offers an elegant, refined feeling, making it a versatile addition in any setting. Each cube weighs under a quarter pound, and measures 1.2\" long by 1.2\" wide and 1.2\" tall.Every item from the \"Artisan Mined\" series is backed by a complete satisfaction guarantee. As is the nature of true, authentic geological specimens, each specimen is completely unique and some can be more striking or appealing to certain people. If you receive and item and are dissatisfied with the item, we will exchange your item free of charge (in some cases allowing you to preview the set before shipment). We hope you understand the variable nature of such products and want nothing more than for you to be completely satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jMrjXOm-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hBARSCI","source_asin":"B06XHRXMKH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XHRXMKH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XHRXMKH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
