window.products.push({"id":986558,"name":"ARTLAND Hand Painted Framed Wall Art Colorful Birds 3-Piece Animal Oil Painting on Canvas for Living Room Artwork for Wall Decor Home Decoration (red ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HUEF9vynL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This beautiful painting is 100% hand-painted oil painting provided by ARTLAND. Environmentally-Friendly Oil We only use museum quality paint since it is environmentally-friendly and never fades. Your painting will look good for years to come. Skilled Artists We employ a group of professional artists. Each artist has more than 10 years experience . We assure you that every piece of art created is exquisite. Competitive Pricing We always offer the lowest prices possible while never compromising on quality. Due to the difference of monitor colors, some painting colors may vary slightly.We try to represent all oil paintings colors accurately. Please refer to the text above for a description of the colors shown in the photo. This is a poetic landscape, the main color is red andthe picture is well-bedded, through the magpie, lake and mountains, the author cleverly separated the close shot, medium shot and perspective, different color represented each level and unified in adark tonal, which depicted a quiet, harmonious night. it is considered as a combination of Chinese and Western innovation works, it not only has the artistic conception of Chinese painting, also in the picture viewers can see the brushwork techniques and rich colors of western painting, for details of the characterization, the author did not portrayed the magpies too much, but took the distant mountains and the white clouds in the sky as focus, through the complex perspective, it set offthe clean, beautiful close shot, a white cloud and magpies have a bright contrastby black and white and opened the space very well, the author compared the two magpies to two lovers by, which were looking at each other in the moonlight, a hint of love throughout the whole work, it intended to express the praise and desire for the great love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HUEF9vynL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARTLAND","source_asin":"B01H4Z7HD6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H4Z7HD6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H4Z7HD6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
