window.products.push({"id":986623,"name":"Xnuoyo Under Door Draft Stopper, Door Weather Stripping Suitable for Outer Door and Inner Door,PVC Cuttable Under Door Seal 37\" Length for Block Wind,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71754J329CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Wear-resistant and Durable] The door draft stopper is made of high-quality PVC material, which has strong oxidation resistance, will not easy deform.Therefore, the door bottom draft plug can withstand the continuous opening and closing of the door without tearing, is very flexible and will not damage your floor. [Energy Saving and Noise Reduction] Are you still worried about the loss of air conditioning and heating, resulting in energy waste? Does the noise and dust from outside the door entering the room affect your mood? Under door draft stopper can help you reduce the loss of indoor air conditioning or heating and save on electricity and fuel bills. The under door seal on both sides are perfectly integrated with the floor to block noise, dirt, dust and ventilation, providing better barrier effect. [Easy to Install] The Weather stripping door seal used for inner and outer doors, quick and easy installation within 5 minutes. Simply cut the door bottom seal to the size of the door, then slide the door seam strip to the bottom of the door for a successful installation. PLEASE NOTE: When the width of the door is less than 4cm, it can be installed by non-marking glue (in the package) without damaging your door. [Length adjustable and washable]: PVC material under door draft stopper, can be cut according to the size of the door, don't worry when the door seam strip is dirty, it can be taken out from under the door and washed under the tap, which can be reused. Don't worry when you receive a slightly bent one, you can choose to heat it with a hair dryer or soak it in cold water for a few minutes to straighten it. [Product Details] The door seam strip length 37 inch, door seam height 2.9CM, suitable for door thickness between 4CM-5.5CM, door bottom gap 0.3CM-1.5CM, suitable for the ground without threshold and level。","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71754J329CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xnuoyo","source_asin":"B0932W11KZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0932W11KZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0932W11KZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
