window.products.push({"id":986829,"name":"Queen Mattress Topper, Cooling with Down Alternative Fillings, Quilted Waterproof, for Up to 21\" Deep Pocket Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vtkd6OscL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOFT AND COMFORTABLE DIAMOND PATTERN DESIGN - The soft touch microfiber surface promotes ventilation while distributing heat evenly to reduce the hot feeling caused by memory foam mattress or foam mattress topper. The diamond pattern ensures the filling stay in place and offering soft support and comfort. 3M SCOTCHGARD MOISTURE MANAGEMENT TECHNOLOGY – Say hello to a clean comfortable bed as our protector not only wicks away moisture and sweat. But also blocks stains/accidents from reaching your mattress’s surface, while easily rinse off when washed. PROTECT YOUR SKIN AND YOUR FAMILY – most competitors settle by using inferior filling that makes them not ideal for babies to sleep on. Our 100% treated filling is not only safe for babies, but also to anyone who rests their sensitive skin against it. WORRIED ABOUT GETTING WET? RELAX AND FORGET: Our unique soft touch microfiber mattress pad is fused with a thin but resilient water-resistant lining. This acts as a barrier to keep your mattress protected from fluids like sleep accidents, sweat or any accidental spills. WASHABLE AND EASY CARE – When it sweat or stains, you will never get them out of memory foam topper or expensive mattress. This mattress topper will take care of them all. Just throw it into a commercial washing machine when it gets dirty, and it will come out fluffy and clean after washing and drying. No expensive dry cleaning necessary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vtkd6OscL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Degrees of Comfort","source_asin":"B08FSM6TVX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FSM6TVX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FSM6TVX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
