window.products.push({"id":986873,"name":"LE LOFT Premium Reusable Chopsticks - Set of 5 Bamboo Chopsticks Gift Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t7Xu8BI6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for a better pair of chopsticks than the cheap disposable ones? Are you a beginner who wants to get better at the traditional method of chopstick eating? Enjoy all your favorite Japanese and Asian dishes the way they were meant to with LE LOFT Reusable Japanese Chopsticks! PRODUCT FEATURES: Set of 5 Reusable ChopsticksPremium Mao BambooAnti-Slip Textured Design8.8” Long Tapered PointAngular Gripping Section JAPANESE CHOPSTICKS – A LEVEL ABOVE Did you know that not all chopsticks are alike? There are distinct differences between Japanese, Korean, Chinese, and Vietnamese chopsticks. Japanese chopsticks are long and taper to a fine point, which makes it easy to grab and manipulate tiny pieces. They are traditionally made of bamboo or wood and lacquered with beautiful coatings to seal the wood and prevent staining and discoloration. Just like their traditional counterparts crafted in Obama, Fukui Prefecture, our reusable chopsticks are made with textured grooves at the end to enable easier grabbing of slippery and wet foods. Ideal for ramen, sushi, noodles, rice, veggies and meats from a wide range of cuisines. MADE FROM PREMIUM MAO BAMBOO Mao bamboo is highly prized for its versatility, but more importantly, this type of bamboo is not eaten by pandas and does not negatively impact the panda environment and ecosystem. BEGINNER FRIENDLY DESIGN The wide end of the chopsticks is angular rather than cylindrical, making it easier to grip and better for beginners. JAPANESE MINIMALIST GIFT Surprise your significant other, friends, family or coworkers with an elegant gift this upcoming holiday! Our sleek, minimalist Japanese packaging takes a departure from the loud packaging of other brands and arrives ready-to-gift right out of the delivery box. NOTE: Hand wash with soap and warm water. Not recommend for use in dishwasher. Click ADD TO CART or BUY NOW Today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t7Xu8BI6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LE LOFT","source_asin":"B08JVLBN1V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986873","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JVLBN1V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JVLBN1V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
