window.products.push({"id":986938,"name":"SEDETA L Shaped Computer Desk, Reversible 86.6\" Home Office Desk or Corner Desk, L Office Desk with Drawer, Power Strip, Storage Cabinet, Monitor Stan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-tG+QYkdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【What can you get?】L shaped desk or long computer desk available, and various options - power strip, drawer, cabinet, bookshelf, storage bag and a removable monitor stand. The tabletop(63\"L*19.7\"W) could hold two desktop computers and one notebook computer, whitch can help you organize your workspace more efficient. 【Reversible Design】The computer desk has 2 kinds of assembly ways, you can change the l-shaped into a long double desk as you need. The 86.6 inch - length size allows 2 person to work side by side without compromising on space. The office desk is perfect for your friends, workmate and you to study, play games and work together. Equipped with 2 AC outlets and 2 PowerIQ-enabled USB charging ports to provide power for up to 4 devices simultaneously. 【Multiple storage】 Where should things be kept when you are studying or working? Corner desk with drawer, cabinet, removable monitor stand, bookshelf and storage bag can help you quickly and efficiently classify storage. The under desk bookshelf offers ample storage space for books, files and other supplies, which reduce the clutter on the desktop and adds enough space for storage and organization under the home office desk. 【Stable Structure】 Metal frames can hold up to 550lbs. Adjustable desk leg pads made the desk keep stable even on carpet. P2 degree engineered wood with high resistance on scratch & friction. The X-shaped structure on the side of the l shape desk helps the table to be more stable. 【Easy Assemble & 100% Warranty】To make assembling this sturdy home office desk as effortless as possible, we have included clear and detailed instructions, numbered parts. If your item arrives damaged, scratched or missing part, please feel free to contact us, we will send you free replacement or offer a partial refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-tG+QYkdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEDETA","source_asin":"B09WRJDBTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-986938","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WRJDBTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WRJDBTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
